            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サンプルのアクセス設定の変更は、サーバーに送信されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This connection belongs to a different MasterKey server. Choose the matching server in Settings > Developer options, then scan again. Your server has not changed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This connection belongs to a different MasterKey server. Choose the matching server in Settings > Developer options, then scan again. Your server has not changed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個連結屬於另一個 MasterKey 伺服器。請在「設定 > 開發者選項」選擇相符的伺服器，再重新掃描。目前的伺服器沒有變更。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この接続は別の MasterKey サーバーのものです。「設定 > 開発者向け設定」で対応するサーバーを選び、もう一度スキャンしてください。現在のサーバーは変更されていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off sample data in Developer options before adding a real key.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn off sample data in Developer options before adding a real key."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請在開發者選項中關閉範例資料，再新增真實 key。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実際のキーを追加する前に、開発者向け設定でサンプルデータをオフにしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key setup belongs to a different MasterKey server. Choose the matching server in Settings > Developer options, then scan again. Your server has not changed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
