            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請附上 App 版本及發生問題的操作步驟。請勿傳送 API keys、授權標頭、密碼或私人提示內容。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリのバージョンと、問題が起きた操作手順をお知らせください。API キー、認証ヘッダー、パスワード、非公開のプロンプトは送らないでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App version": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App version"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 版本"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリのバージョン"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Provider credits": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Provider credits"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服務商額度"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロバイダーの残高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MasterKey beta is free. Model usage is billed separately to your provider account. A ChatGPT or Claude subscription does not supply API credits. OpenRouter uses its own balance.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MasterKey beta is free. Model usage is billed separately to your provider account. A ChatGPT or Claude subscription does not supply API credits. OpenRouter uses its own balance."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MasterKey 測試版免費。模型用量會由你的服務商帳號另外計費。ChatGPT 或 Claude 訂閱不包含 API 額度。OpenRouter 使用自己的餘額。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MasterKey ベータ版は無料です。モデルの利用料はプロバイダーのアカウントに別途請求されます。ChatGPT や Claude のサブスクリプションに API の利用残高は含まれません。OpenRouter は専用の残高を使います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If a provider reports insufficient credits, check the billing account or project that issued your key. Adding a key does not add credits.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If a provider reports insufficient credits, check the billing account or project that issued your key. Adding a key does not add credits."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若服務商回報額度不足，請確認發出 key 的計費帳號或專案。新增 key 並不會增加額度。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "残高不足と表示された場合は、キーを発行した請求アカウントやプロジェクトを確認してください。キーを追加しても残高は増えません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A request is uncertain": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A request is uncertain"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請求結果未確定"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リクエストの結果が未確定の場合"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The provider may already have processed the request. Check its recorded status and your provider usage before starting another request. MasterKey does not automatically retry an uncertain model call.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The provider may already have processed the request. Check its recorded status and your provider usage before starting another request. MasterKey does not automatically retry an uncertain model call."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服務商可能已處理請求。開始另一個請求前，請先查看記錄狀態與服務商的用量。MasterKey 不會自動重試結果未確定的模型呼叫。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロバイダーがすでにリクエストを処理した可能性があります。別のリクエストを始める前に、記録された状態とプロバイダーの利用状況を確認してください。MasterKey は結果が未確定のモデル呼び出しを自動で再試行しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connecting and notifications": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connecting and notifications"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連結與通知"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接続と通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan the connection QR on the app’s website and check its source before allowing access. If a code expires, start a new connection on that website.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan the connection QR on the app’s website and check its source before allowing access. If a code expires, start a new connection on that website."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描 App 網站上的連結 QR code，並在允許存取前確認來源。若代碼過期，請在該網站開始新的連結。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリのウェブサイトで接続用の QR コードをスキャンし、アクセスを許可する前に接続元を確認してください。コードの有効期限が切れた場合は、そのウェブサイトで新しい接続を始めてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If notifications are disabled, open Inbox to review waiting requests. Notification permission can be changed in iPhone Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If notifications are disabled, open Inbox to review waiting requests. Notification permission can be changed in iPhone Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若通知已關閉，請開啟收件匣查看待批准的請求。你可以在 iPhone「設定」中變更通知權限。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知がオフの場合は、受信トレイで確認待ちのリクエストを確認してください。通知の許可は iPhone の「設定」で変更できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who operates MasterKey": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Who operates MasterKey"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MasterKey 的營運者"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MasterKey の運営者"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Joseph Chen operates the hosted MasterKey service. Contact josephchen637@gmail.com with privacy questions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Joseph Chen operates the hosted MasterKey service. Contact josephchen637@gmail.com with privacy questions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "託管的 MasterKey 服務由 Joseph Chen 營運。隱私相關問題請聯絡 josephchen637@gmail.com。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ホスト型 MasterKey サービスは Joseph Chen が運営しています。プライバシーに関するお問い合わせは josephchen637@gmail.com までご連絡ください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your keys": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your keys"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 keys"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あなたのキー"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Provider keys are sent to your selected MasterKey server and encrypted there. Apps receive scoped permission tokens, never your original key. The server decrypts a key to forward an allowed request; its operator must still be trusted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Provider keys are sent to your selected MasterKey server and encrypted there. Apps receive scoped permission tokens, never your original key. The server decrypts a key to forward an allowed request; its operator must still be trusted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服務商 key 會傳送至你選擇的 MasterKey 伺服器，並在該處加密儲存。Apps 只收到有範圍限制的授權 token，不會取得原始 key。伺服器會解密 key 以轉送獲准的請求，因此你仍需信任伺服器營運者。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロバイダーのキーは、選択した MasterKey サーバーに送信され、暗号化して保存されます。アプリに渡されるのは範囲が限定されたアクセストークンだけで、元のキーは渡されません。サーバーは許可済みのリクエストを転送する際にキーを復号するため、サーバー運営者への信頼は必要です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Requests and history": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requests and history"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請求與歷史紀錄"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リクエストと履歴"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MasterKey stores request contents, provider responses, timestamps and usage-derived costs so you can inspect them later. Approved request contents are sent to the selected provider, and the calling app receives the response. That app may keep its own copy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MasterKey stores request contents, provider responses, timestamps and usage-derived costs so you can inspect them later. Approved request contents are sent to the selected provider, and the calling app receives the response. That app may keep its own copy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MasterKey 會儲存請求內容、服務商回應、時間與依用量計算的費用，供你日後查閱。獲准的請求內容會送至選定的服務商，呼叫的 App 則會收到回應。該 App 可能自行保留副本。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MasterKey は後から確認できるよう、リクエスト内容、プロバイダーの応答、日時、利用量に基づく費用を保存します。許可したリクエスト内容は選択したプロバイダーに送信され、呼び出し元のアプリが応答を受け取ります。そのアプリが独自にコピーを保存する場合があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Treat prompts and responses as account data. Avoid including information you do not want the selected provider or calling app to receive.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Treat prompts and responses as account data. Avoid including information you do not want the selected provider or calling app to receive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請將提示內容與回應視為帳號資料。不要加入你不希望選定服務商或呼叫 App 收到的資訊。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロンプトと応答はアカウントデータとして扱ってください。選択したプロバイダーや呼び出し元のアプリに渡したくない情報は含めないでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Control and support": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Control and support"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "管理與支援"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "管理とサポート"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove a provider key in Keys or disconnect an app in Apps. Removing a key does not delete your provider account or cancel a provider subscription. Already-sent requests cannot be recalled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove a provider key in Keys or disconnect an app in Apps. Removing a key does not delete your provider account or cancel a provider subscription. Already-sent requests cannot be recalled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以在 Keys 移除服務商 key，或在 Apps 中斷 App 連結。移除 key 不會刪除服務商帳號或取消服務商訂閱。已送出的請求無法收回。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「キー」でプロバイダーのキーを削除したり、「アプリ」で接続を解除したりできます。キーを削除しても、プロバイダーのアカウントやサブスクリプションは削除・解約されません。送信済みのリクエストは取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The beta does not add advertising trackers or third-party analytics SDKs. Apple and hosting providers may process service and diagnostic data under their own policies.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The beta does not add advertising trackers or third-party analytics SDKs. Apple and hosting providers may process service and diagnostic data under their own policies."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "測試版沒有加入廣告追蹤器或第三方分析 SDK。Apple 與託管服務商可能依照各自政策處理服務與診斷資料。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ベータ版には広告トラッカーや第三者の分析 SDK を追加していません。Apple やホスティング事業者が、それぞれのポリシーに従ってサービスや診断に関するデータを処理する場合があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
